    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this charming one-bedroom mid-terrace bungalow to the market, ideally positioned in the heart of North Strand, Dublin 3. No. 18B Newcomen Avenue is tucked away in a peaceful setting while enjoying every convenience the city has to offer. This character-filled home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, situated within walking distance of Dublin City Centre, the IFSC and East Point Business Park. An abundance of local amenities including Fairview Park, Clontarf Promenade, schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities are all nearby. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport with numerous Dublin Bus routes and Clontarf DART Station within easy reach, while the Port Tunnel, M50 and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nBright and well-laid-out internal accommodation extending to approximately 48 sq.m. comprises an entrance hallway, a cosy living room with feature fireplace and built-in shelving, a spacious double bedroom, a separate kitchen with access to a covered rear courtyard, and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nAlthough requiring some upgrading and modernisation, No. 18B offers exceptional potential for buyers looking to create a stylish home in a prime city location. Additional benefits include its charming period character, private covered courtyard and superb potential to extend or reconfigure (subject to the necessary planning permission).\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for any buyer seeking a home with enormous potential in one of Dublin's most established and convenient residential locations. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 832 3302 or 01 541 1455 to arrange a viewing.\r\n \r\nKey Features\r\n \r\n<ul>\r\n <li>c.48 sq.m.</li>\r\n <li>BER E2</li>\r\n <li>Built c.1890</li>\r\n <li>One-bedroom mid-terrace bungalow</li>\r\n <li>Character-filled home</li>\r\n <li>Spacious double bedroom</li>\r\n <li>Feature fireplace</li>\r\n <li>Covered rear courtyard</li>\r\n <li>Excellent renovation potential</li>\r\n <li>Scope to extend/reconfigure (S.P.P.)</li>\r\n <li>Walking distance to Dublin City Centre</li>\r\n <li>Close to IFSC & East Point Business Park</li>\r\n <li>Excellent transport links including DART</li>\r\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers & investors</li>\r\n <li>Viewing highly advised</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nDirections - DO3 Y302"
      },
      {
